WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:02.757
(rock music)

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:08.356
- Montana is a landlocked state.

00:00:08.356 --> 00:00:12.122
It blows my mind everyday,
but there is waves in the river

00:00:12.122 --> 00:00:14.076
and you can surf 'em on surfboards

00:00:14.076 --> 00:00:15.660
just like you would in the ocean.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:19.731
We have a huge surf
culture here in Missoula.

00:00:19.731 --> 00:00:22.507
(rock music)

00:00:22.507 --> 00:00:25.392
My name's Kevin Benhardt Brown, I go by KB,

00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:27.831
and I own Strongwater
Mountain Surf Company.

00:00:27.831 --> 00:00:30.498
(tools blaring)

00:00:33.394 --> 00:00:35.211
We are the original mountain surf shop

00:00:35.211 --> 00:00:37.906
and still the only surf shop
in the state of Montana.

00:00:37.906 --> 00:00:40.656
I mean, it's cowboy country here.

00:00:43.098 --> 00:00:44.546
Surfing is in my soul,

00:00:44.546 --> 00:00:47.291
one of my very first, earliest
memories at the age of three

00:00:47.291 --> 00:00:49.579
is visiting my grandparents in San Diego

00:00:49.579 --> 00:00:51.670
and seeing surfing in the ocean.

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:53.275
And for whatever reason

00:00:53.275 --> 00:00:55.650
I've been kind of searching
for surfing my whole life

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:58.002
and I happen to be here
in Missoula, Montana

00:00:58.002 --> 00:01:00.502
and tapped into river surfing.

00:01:01.354 --> 00:01:04.092
In the river, it's a standing wave,

00:01:04.092 --> 00:01:06.839
so the wave is essentially stationary.

00:01:06.839 --> 00:01:09.255
You're going back and
forth across the wave,

00:01:09.255 --> 00:01:11.480
but the wave is kind of in one place,

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:14.026
the water's comin' at
you, it's pretty amazing.

00:01:14.026 --> 00:01:16.443
(rock music)

00:01:21.314 --> 00:01:22.320
You know, we've built

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:24.788
a really strong river surf community here.

00:01:24.788 --> 00:01:28.955
There's just a ton of support
and good vibes, good energy.

00:01:30.038 --> 00:01:32.322
(water splashing)

00:01:32.322 --> 00:01:35.204
This whole connection with
nature correlates directly with

00:01:35.204 --> 00:01:38.732
kind of that same vibe
that you get in the ocean.

00:01:38.732 --> 00:01:40.765
Not a lot of people know
about river surfing,

00:01:40.765 --> 00:01:43.739
but there's river surfing
communities popping up everywhere

00:01:43.739 --> 00:01:47.197
and it's just starting to explode.

00:01:47.197 --> 00:01:48.259
For me personally,

00:01:48.259 --> 00:01:52.061
it's about doing what people
don't think you can do

00:01:52.061 --> 00:01:53.942
and proving that you can do it

00:01:53.942 --> 00:01:55.970
and you know, just getting out

00:01:55.970 --> 00:01:58.948
and having a good time, sharing the sport.

00:01:58.948 --> 00:02:03.115
It's exciting and fun to be
on this whole new frontier.

00:02:05.781 --> 00:02:08.864
(electronic dinging)

